  "body": "Where Quality Meets Townhouse Living\r\n\r\n* Concrete Tilt Slab Construction, Double Glazed, with Heat Pump. \r\n\r\n* Freehold Title - no body corporate or society fees associated.\r\n\r\n* Brand new, never lived in. Code of Compliance & title issued 24th August 2026.\r\n\r\n* 3 Bedrooms, 1 full bathroom plus powder room downstairs for guests.\r\n\r\n* Fully fenced with a private low maintenance courtyard.\r\n\r\n* 1 allocated car park within the podium, with plenty of off street parking. \r\n\r\n* 108m² internal floor area (approx.) / 132m² land area (approx.).\r\n\r\n* Carpet upstairs throughout the bedrooms, tiled bathrooms, engineered wood in the main living space - easy maintenance for cleaning. \r\n\r\n* 25E has an open park space next door, with fewer neighbours to surround. \r\n\r\n* Well equipped kitchen with Bosch appliances throughout. \r\n\r\n\r\nBUY NOW & take advantage of a complimentary: \r\n\r\n* Whiteware Package \r\n* Curtains & Blinds Package \r\n\r\nEnquire for further details & discuss your future options in Torbay. \r\n\r\n*Please note, photos are pictured of another townhouse within the complex*",
